  84:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
  85:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * Alternately the PLL and clocks can be initialised using below method which provides greater cont
  86:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
  87:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  * \code
  88:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Clock/Std/IfxClock.h ****  *
