 363:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h **** /** \brief Initializes the service request control register.
 364:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  * Note: In case Virtualization is disabled VM Number is always written with zero.
 365:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  * Note: In case of re-initialization, use IfxSrc_deinit to reset the TOS to F.
 366:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  *
 367:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  * \param[inout] src          Pointer to the Service Request Control register which should be initi
 368:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  * \param[in]    typOfService Type of interrupt service provider. Range: \ref IfxSrc_Tos.
 369:../Libraries/iLLD/TC4xx/CpuGeneric/Src/Std/IfxSrc.h ****  * \param[in]    priority     Interrupt priority.
